{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"⛰🏖 Roanoke Island Exploration","id":"733827637901787206","name":"hex-p-the-lighthouse","position":98,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827637901787206","content":"They think of Daysong's death, still feeling that he could have survived in physical form had he not used up a powerful spell on Web the week before. They think of Sandigill's death and how he might still be alive. They think of how it took them the death of a friend to actually be spurred into action. They think of how they ran when Baeshra died. How they still hate those woods. They think of how the Knights and Masons still argue, and that somehow they could have talked better to Florian. They think of everything with Lolth, and how that could have gone so much better in so many ways. They think of Hiram's death, and the fact that Solomon yet lives. They think of how they didn't handle their fear better, pushed others away. They think of all the times they could have helped baeshra and didn't, or helped the town and didn't. They think of how they still struggle so hard to control their primal urges, to be kind first, especially to strangers. They think of how it would still be so easy for them to be the self they fear. They count out their regrets one by one, breathing them in and out, hoping in some way to release them. They look up to the wardens, exhaling a long breath. “You all powerful enough. Will assume you got all that. Unless want Web to say out loud.”","created_at":"2020-08-20T03:30:43.556000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745847258322305196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
